# Goliath Daydreamer: "cast a spell from among cards you own in exile with dream counters on them" -- another card of Bot1's in
# exile without a counter is not among them. Bot1 bolts Bot2 from the hand on turn 3 (the Bolt is exiled with a dream counter)
# and imprints a Burst Lightning on a Chrome Mox (exiled with no counter). Attacking, the trigger offers only the Bolt: the
# Burst Lightning cannot be chosen, and stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mountain
Goliath Daydreamer
Lightning Bolt
Chrome Mox
Burst Lightning
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

